  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business Forum - Doing business in Moldova for Dutch companies in Romania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project involves organizing a seminar on doing business in Moldova for Dutch enterprises in Romania.Moldova is not very well known to Dutch companies. Particularly Dutch companies that have never set foot in Eastern Europe.Therefore, this project aims to interest Dutch companies already in that region (in neighbouring Romania) and inform them about doing business in Moldova. It is reportedly easier to move from Romania to Moldova than to start anew from the Netherlands to Moldova due to the significant presence of Dutch businesses in Romania.This project aims to tap into this group of Dutch companies and interest them to enter the Moldovan market. By already being in Romania, they show an appetite for riskier markets, know the region and the local ways of doing business and may be interested in looking for opportunities in neighbouring Moldova. Out of approximately 200 Dutch entrepreneurs active in Romania, twenty companies are expected to participate in the seminar.</narrative>
  </description>
